    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see what you mean. It's like the skill is being sacrificed for the sake of the message. But don't you think some people would argue that the old definition of \"technical excellence\" or \"beauty\" was just a way for the establishment to decide what art was \"worthy\" of being seen? Like, if we only value what's traditionally beautiful, aren't we just gatekeeping which voices get heard?",
